B.a34=new A.hj("A purchase records what you owe. A payment settles it and moves cash. Supplier advances and opening adjustments stay separate.",B.bk,null)
B.a35=new A.hj("Payments show the actual account outflow and its allocation to bills. Reversed payments stay in history. Bill filters apply to Expenses and Overview.",B.bk,null)
B.a36=new A.hj("Scenario planning becomes available when this view has activity and every income / expense invoice has a saved USD conversion.",B.bk,null)
B.a37=new A.hj("How to read these KPIs: operating results exclude capital and transfers. USD uses each invoice\u2019s saved rate. A surplus is income minus expenses and purchase payments, counted once when paid; it is not an account balance or accrual profit. Comparisons use the same filters over the preceding equal-length period (whole months for booking reports).",B.bk,null)
B.a39=new A.hj("Existing bills keep their saved category name. A category with unpaid expenses must stay active until those expenses are paid or voided.",B.eR,null)
