B.a3f=new A.hj("Set the USD / IQD rate on Overview before recording an IQD invoice or a payment in another currency.",B.bk,null)
B.a3g=new A.hj("Advances and returns move money between a clinic account and a person\u2019s wallet. Spending is recorded as an expense. IQD and USD balances stay separate.",B.bk,null)
B.a3h=new A.hj("This records an unpaid purchase. No cash moves until a payment is saved.",B.bk,null)
